  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4102.02 Issuance of Certification for Additional Truck Weights",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-09-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4102.02 Issuance of Certification for Additional Truck Weights.\n\n(a) A vehicle which meets the requirements of Saf-C 4102.01 shall be eligible for certification to carry additional truck weights as provided in RSA 266:18-b.\n\n(b) Each applicant shall pay the appropriate registration fee for the additional truck weights pursuant to RSA 261:141.\n\n(c) The department shall issue certification on a registration year basis and it shall be valid until the end of the registration year for which it is issued unless suspended or revoked as provided in Saf-C 4102.03.\n\n(d) Any vehicle which has been issued certification for additional truck weights shall be renewed in accordance with the requirements of Saf-C 4102.01.\n\n(e) If a vehicle is modified in any manner or if the original certification is lost, the requirements of Saf-C 4102.01 shall be completed.\n\n(f) The department shall issue a decal to any vehicle certified for additional truck weights, which shall be visibly displayed on the front license plate of the vehicle.\n\n(g) The department shall issue a decal to any trailer certified for additional truck weights, which shall be displayed on the rear license plate of the trailer.\n\n(h) If a certification is suspended or revoked pursuant to Saf-C 4102.03, the owner or lessee of the vehicle shall return the decal(s) to the department.\n\n(i) The certification for additional truck weights shall be kept in the vehicle at all times.\n\nSource. #4193, eff 12-30-86; amd by #4251, eff 3-31-87, EXPIRED 3-31-93\n\nNew. #5628, eff 5-25-93; ss by #6946, eff 2-25-99, EXPIRED: 2-25-07\n\nNew. #8881, INTERIM, eff 5-3-07, EXPIRES: 10-30-07; ss by #9000, eff 9-29-07, EXPIRED: 9-29-15\n\nNew. #11050, INTERIM, eff 3-5-16, EXPIRED: 9-1-16 (from Saf-C 4102.03)\n\nNew. #11190, eff 9-22-16",
